  "about": "Taste packs: folders of tags a member adds by what they listen to (docs/STARTER_TAGS_2026-11.md). Names come from the Genre directory (supabase/seed-data/directory/genre.json; directorySlug is the value, or null for the few names it doesn't have), in Title Case like the starter tags, ranked by how many members use them. IDs are fixed so the same pack is the same folder and tags everywhere: the folder is sub_ + Tagify's hash of taste-pack:folder:<key> and each tag tag_ + the hash of taste-pack:tag:<tag page slug>, except that a tag version 1 of the starter tags had (Lo-fi, Blues, Country, Reggae) keeps that ID. A tag in two packs is one tag. Community's rows are generated from this file (scripts/directory/taste-packs-to-sql.mjs).",
